    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23401" root="شوه" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَائِهٌ</span></b>  <i>Envying:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُوَّهٌ</span>: (As, Lh, TA:) or the
latter signifies persons <i>practising artifice to smite
men with the</i> [<i>evil</i>] <i>eye.</i> (JK.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَائِهُ البَصَرِ</span>,
(JK, S, K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">البَصَرِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَاهُ</span></b> , (JK, K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَاهِى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">البَصَرِ</span>, (JK, TA, and S and K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شهو</span>,) the
last formed by transposition from the first, (S in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شهو</span>,) A man <i>sharp of sight.</i> (JK, S, K.)

